{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"5. 40자로 늘린다","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-5-Expand-to-40-Characters","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"한 글자가 되면 나머지는 표를 채우는 일입니다. 다만 채우면서 무엇이 서로 헷갈리는지 기록해야 합니다."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"튜토리얼","title":"튜토리얼","identifiers":["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-0-Project-Setup","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-1-Mock-Hand","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-2-Pose-Features","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-3-Reference-Poses","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-4-Scoring-and-Coaching","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"text":"5.1","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"51"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"자음 19자와 모음 21자를 표로 채웁니다. 손바닥 방향으로 갈리는 글자에는 표시를 남겨, 그 글자들만 수향에 더 큰 가중치를 줍니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Jamo.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 36–38행"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    static let orientationCritical: Set<Jamo> = [.ssangSiot, .o, .yo, .u, .yu, .eu, .i]","","    var isOrientationCritical: Bool { Jamo.orientationCritical.contains(self) }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"text":"5.2","anchor":"52","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"40자 전체와 비교해 가장 가까운 순으로 줄을 세웁니다. 40번의 비교는 사실상 공짜입니다 — 프레임당 1ms 예산 안에 충분히 들어갑니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PoseMatcher.swift"},{"text":" 49–53행","type":"text"}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    func rank(_ feature: PoseFeature, in library: ReferenceLibrary) -> [PoseMatch] {","        library.all()","            .map { match(feature, to: $0.value, jamo: $0.key) }","            .sorted { $0.distance < $1.distance }","    }"]},{"level":3,"text":"5.3","anchor":"53","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"표를 채우면서 반드시 해야 할 일."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" 기준 표 안에서 서로 너무 가까운 자모 쌍을 자동으로 찾습니다. 거리가 1 미만인 쌍은 현재 표로는 갈라낼 수 없습니다. 이 목록에만 나중에 CoreML 보조 분류기를 붙이면 됩니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"⚠️ 자리표시자 표로는 갈라내지 못하는 쌍이 16개 나옵니다. 실측 포즈로 교체하면 줄어듭니다. 화면 위쪽에 그 개수가 항상 표시됩니다.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"warning","type":"aside","name":"Warning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"관련 코드 — ","type":"text"},{"code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 92–106행","type":"text"}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    func confusablePairs(threshold: Float = 1, matcher: PoseMatcher = PoseMatcher())","        -> [(Jamo, Jamo, Float)] {","        if threshold == 1, let cached = confusableCache { return cached }","        let items = all().sorted { $0.key.rawValue < $1.key.rawValue }","        var out: [(Jamo, Jamo, Float)] = []","        for i in items.indices {","            for j in (i + 1)..<items.count {","                let d = matcher.match(items[i].value, to: items[j].value, jamo: items[j].key).distance","                if d < threshold { out.append((items[i].key, items[j].key, d)) }","            }","        }","        let sorted = out.sorted { $0.2 < $1.2 }","        if threshold == 1 { confusableCache = sorted }","        return sorted","    }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"54","text":"5.4"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"창 화면을 조립합니다. 자모 선택 · 판정 카드 · 오차 그래프 · 설정을 차례로 세우고, 아래 오너먼트에 몰입 공간을 여닫는 버튼을 답니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TutorView.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 10–34행"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    var body: some View {","        @Bindable var model = model","","        NavigationStack {","            ScrollView {","                VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 28) {","                    header","                    JamoPicker(selection: $model.target)","                    VerdictCard()","                    ErrorChart()","                    settings","                }","                .padding(28)","            }","            .navigationTitle(\"지화 튜터\")","            .toolbar {","                ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomOrnament) {","                    Button(spaceOpen ? \"연습 끝내기\" : \"연습 시작\") {","                        Task { await toggleSpace() }","                    }","                    .buttonStyle(.borderedProminent)","                }","            }","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"anchor":"55","type":"heading","text":"5.5"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"자음 19 · 모음 21 그리드입니다. 손바닥 방향으로 갈리는 글자에는 "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"점을 하나 찍어"}]},{"text":" 눈에 보이게 합니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JamoPicker.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 16–45행"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    private func section(_ title: String, _ items: [Jamo]) -> some View {","        VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 8) {","            Text(title).font(.headline)","            LazyVGrid(columns: columns, spacing: 8) {","                ForEach(items) { jamo in","                    Button {","                        selection = jamo","                    } label: {","                        Text(jamo.rawValue)","                            .font(.title2)","                            .frame(maxWidth: .infinity, minHeight: 44)","                            .overlay(alignment: .topTrailing) {","                                if jamo.isOrientationCritical {","                                    Circle()","                                        .frame(width: 5, height: 5)","                                        .foregroundStyle(.tint)","                                        .padding(4)","                                }","                            }","                    }","                    .buttonStyle(.bordered)","                    .background(jamo == selection ? Color.accentColor.opacity(0.35) : .clear,","                                in: .rect(cornerRadius: 12))","                }","            }","            Text(\"점이 붙은 글자는 손바닥 방향으로 갈립니다. 회전 정규화를 적용하면 서로 구별할 수 없게 됩니다.\")","                .font(.caption2)","                .foregroundStyle(.secondary)","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"56","text":"5.6","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"판정 카드입니다. 유지 시간이 링으로 차오르고 통과하면 초록으로 바뀝니다. 목표와 다른 글자에 더 가까우면 그것도 함께 알려 줍니다 — 어느 쪽으로 틀렸는지 아는 것이 학습에 도움이 됩니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VerdictCard.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 7–51행"}]}]},{"code":["    var body: some View {","        GroupBox {","            HStack(alignment: .center, spacing: 24) {","                ZStack {","                    Circle()","                        .stroke(.quaternary, lineWidth: 8)","                    Circle()","                        .trim(from: 0, to: model.holdProgress)","                        .stroke(passed ? Color.green : Color.orange,","                                style: StrokeStyle(lineWidth: 8, lineCap: .round))","                        .rotationEffect(.degrees(-90))","                    Text(model.target.rawValue).font(.system(size: 44, weight: .semibold))","                }","                .frame(width: 110, height: 110)","                .animation(.linear(duration: 0.1), value: model.holdProgress)","","                VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 8) {","                    Text(headline)","                        .font(.title3.weight(.semibold))","                        .foregroundStyle(passed ? .green : .primary)","","                    if let advice = model.advice {","                        Label(advice, systemImage: \"hand.point.up.left\")","                            .font(.body)","                    }","","                    if let best = model.bestGuess, best.jamo != model.target, !passed {","                        Text(\"지금 손 모양은 ‘\\(best.jamo.rawValue)’에 더 가깝습니다.\")","                            .font(.caption)","                            .foregroundStyle(.secondary)","                    }","","                    if let m = model.currentMatch {","                        Text(\"거리 \\(m.distance, format: .number.precision(.fractionLength(2))) · 수향 오차 \\(Int(m.orientationError * 180 \/ .pi))°\")","                            .font(.caption2)","                            .foregroundStyle(.secondary)","                    }","                }","                Spacer(minLength: 0)","            }","            .padding(.vertical, 10)","            .accessibilityElement(children: .combine)","            .accessibilityLabel(Text(headline + (model.advice.map { \". \" + $0 } ?? \"\")))","        }","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"57","text":"5.7"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"화면을 붙입니다. 자모 선택, 판정 링, 교정 문장, 그리고 손가락별 오차 막대. 오차 막대에는 허용 오차선을 함께 그려 지금 어디쯤인지 눈으로 보이게 합니다."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ErrorChart.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 21–58행"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    private func row(_ finger: FingerName) -> some View {","        let degrees = worstDegrees(finger)","        let tolerance = CGFloat(model.toleranceDegrees)","        let over = degrees > tolerance","        return HStack(spacing: 12) {","            Text(finger.korean)","                .font(.callout)","                .frame(width: 44, alignment: .leading)","","            GeometryReader { geo in","                let full = geo.size.width","                let unit: CGFloat = full \/ 45.0     \/\/ 0…45도 눈금","                ZStack(alignment: .leading) {","                    Capsule().fill(.quaternary).frame(height: 10)","                    Capsule()","                        .fill(over ? Color.orange : Color.green)","                        .frame(width: min(degrees * unit, full), height: 10)","                    Rectangle()","                        .fill(.primary.opacity(0.5))","                        .frame(width: 1.5, height: 18)","                        .offset(x: tolerance * unit)","                }","                .frame(maxHeight: .infinity, alignment: .center)","            }","            .frame(height: 20)","","            Text(\"\\(Int(degrees))°\")","                .font(.caption.monospacedDigit())","                .frame(width: 40, alignment: .trailing)","","            Text(over ? \"초과\" : \"통과\")","                .font(.caption2)","                .frame(width: 34)","                .foregroundStyle(over ? .orange : .secondary)","        }","        .accessibilityElement(children: .combine)","        .accessibilityLabel(\"\\(finger.korean) 오차 \\(Int(degrees))도, \\(over ? \"허용 오차 초과\" : \"통과\")\")","    }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"5.8","level":3,"anchor":"58"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"색이 아니라 ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"길이와 형태"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":"로 구분하고, 모든 판정에 접근성 레이블을 붙입니다. 청각장애 학습자가 주 사용자인 앱에서 소리로만 알려 주는 설계는 성립하지 않고, 색맹 사용자도 읽을 수 있어야 합니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ErrorChart.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 56–67행"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["        .accessibilityElement(children: .combine)","        .accessibilityLabel(\"\\(finger.korean) 오차 \\(Int(degrees))도, \\(over ? \"허용 오차 초과\" : \"통과\")\")","    }","","    \/\/\/ 손가락 하나에 관절 3개. 그중 가장 큰 오차를 대표값으로 쓴다.","    private func worstDegrees(_ finger: FingerName) -> CGFloat {","        guard let errors = model.currentMatch?.bendError,","              errors.count == PoseFeature.bendCount else { return 0 }","        let slice = errors[(finger.rawValue * 3)..<(finger.rawValue * 3 + 3)]","        return CGFloat((slice.max() ?? 0) * 180 \/ .pi)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"text":"5.9","anchor":"59","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"40자 그리드에서 글자를 고르면 그 글자로 채점이 바뀝니다. 여기까지가 시뮬레이터에서 확인할 수 있는 전부입니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ErrorChart.swift"},{"text":" 56–67행","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["        .accessibilityElement(children: .combine)","        .accessibilityLabel(\"\\(finger.korean) 오차 \\(Int(degrees))도, \\(over ? \"허용 오차 초과\" : \"통과\")\")","    }","","    \/\/\/ 손가락 하나에 관절 3개. 그중 가장 큰 오차를 대표값으로 쓴다.","    private func worstDegrees(_ finger: FingerName) -> CGFloat {","        guard let errors = model.currentMatch?.bendError,","              errors.count == PoseFeature.bendCount else { return 0 }","        let slice = errors[(finger.rawValue * 3)..<(finger.rawValue * 3 + 3)]","        return CGFloat((slice.max() ?? 0) * 180 \/ .pi)","    }","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89-%EA%B2%B0%EA%B3%BC","text":"실행 결과"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"5단계를 마치면 나오는 화면"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"step5.jpg"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"visionOS 26.2 시뮬레이터에서 직접 캡처","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"%EC%B2%B4%ED%81%AC%ED%8F%AC%EC%9D%B8%ED%8A%B8","text":"체크포인트"},{"text":"여기까지 하면","anchor":"%EC%97%AC%EA%B8%B0%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%ED%95%98%EB%A9%B4","level":4,"type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"자음 19 + 모음 21 = 40개 버튼이 보인다","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"글자를 바꾸면 판정 대상이 바뀐다","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"헷갈리는 쌍 개수가 표시된다","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"여기까지의 파일만으로 빌드가 통과한다","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"안 되면 확인할 것","anchor":"%EC%95%88-%EB%90%98%EB%A9%B4-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%A0-%EA%B2%83","level":4,"type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"첫 렌더에서 모음 그리드가 비어 보일 수 있습니다. 한 번 클릭하면 정상으로 돌아옵니다 (LazyVGrid 레이아웃 타이밍).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"모든 글자가 같은 점수로 나오면 기준 표가 비어 있는 것입니다."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"계속하기","type":"heading","anchor":"%EA%B3%84%EC%86%8D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://JihwaTutor/documentation/JihwaTutor/Step-0-Project-Setup":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/docu